WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,580 --> 00:00:04,140
Zhou Peng and Zhang Yi are really too much

2
00:00:04,140 --> 00:00:06,340
I just asked him for some food to survive

3
00:00:06,340 --> 00:00:08,540
He made excessive and unreasonable demands to coerce me.

4
00:00:08,540 --> 00:00:11,700
If you clean me up as a person, I will never compromise on this condition.

5
00:00:11,700 --> 00:00:14,100
Zhang Yi is too selfish and mean

6
00:00:14,100 --> 00:00:15,780
How dare I embarrass you like this?

7
00:00:15,780 --> 00:00:18,020
I will definitely stand up for you and seek justice.

8
00:00:18,020 --> 00:00:20,900
Zhang Yi’s house is stocked with a lot of food

9
00:00:20,900 --> 00:00:24,140
And Pilu keeps you warm all day long, keeping you warm and refreshed.

10
00:00:24,140 --> 00:00:26,940
Why did he occupy such a good refuge all by himself?

11
00:00:26,940 --> 00:00:29,100
Let's fight for the place to stay

12
00:00:29,300 --> 00:00:32,660
From now on, how about the three of us living together in peace and stability?

13
00:00:32,660 --> 00:00:35,250
Don't worry, Yu Qing

14
00:00:35,250 --> 00:00:36,970
Leave this matter entirely to me.

15
00:00:36,970 --> 00:00:38,290
I'll definitely help you get it done

16
00:00:38,290 --> 00:00:39,930
Zhang Yifang is heavily trusted

17
00:00:39,930 --> 00:00:41,980
He will definitely resist if he is forced to escape.

18
00:00:41,980 --> 00:00:43,780
We must carry the building tools

19
00:00:43,780 --> 00:00:45,140
Take the initiative

20
00:00:45,140 --> 00:00:47,860
It’s best to solve the trouble once and for all

21
00:00:47,860 --> 00:00:51,560
How to prevent the possibility of his counterattack?

22
00:00:51,560 --> 00:00:53,080
You don't want to stand up for me

23
00:00:53,080 --> 00:00:55,880
It can be seen that all the words of hope that I said before are empty words.

24
00:00:55,880 --> 00:00:56,960
Don't be angry Yu Qing

25
00:00:56,960 --> 00:00:57,960
I listen to you all

26
00:00:57,960 --> 00:00:59,080
As you say
